/*
 * Miltalk CAMERA KIT - TESTER (receives weights, classifies, points servo)
 * Board: ESP32-S3 N16R8 CAM (onboard OV5640) - same PCB as the trainer
 * Display: ST7735 TFT, PORTRAIT
 *
 * - Receives sumA/sumB/countA/countB from the trainer over ESP-NOW
 *   (trainer: hold all 4 buttons). Saved to flash, reloaded at boot.
 * - TEST button: capture -> classify (identical pipeline + nearest centroid)
 *   -> servo points to SET A or SET B for a few seconds -> back to centre.
 *
 * ARDUINO IDE SETTINGS:
 *   Board: ESP32S3 Dev Module | PSRAM: OPI PSRAM | Flash: 16MB
 *   Partition: Huge APP | USB CDC On Boot: Enabled
 *   esp32 board package 3.x
 * LIBRARIES: Adafruit GFX, Adafruit ST7735 and ST7789
 */

